{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0213_1000_p", "source_sha256": "25a9963ba3554e0a2e2aa4e13a1670d4427fa569f974c61d635548db76d6a89f", "ja": "（『アイグラ！！』のグラビア企画に載せる写真を\n撮影することになった。今日は未来の撮影だ！）", "zh": "（要为刊登在《偶像写真！！》写真企划中的照片进行拍摄。今天是未来的拍摄！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0213_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "eb640e15bf7fb23580e739ee2845a048883c16f16a629b1a0e1ab23b88312893", "ja": "お待たせしました、{$P$}さん！\nいいお天気でよかったですね～♪　フンフフーン♪", "zh": "让你久等了，{$P$}先生！  \n天气真好，太棒了呢～♪ 哼哼哼～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0213_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ae40816f658fd3f858b0f60f36f7b715b45b00dc0090a9f1b29c30c2dfe356c0", "ja": "ああ、よかったな……。\n未来も調子よさそうじゃないか？", "zh": "啊，那就好……\n未来看起来状态也不错嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0213_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "fbff9907dae6229bd7f8eeb148d4021b0023b242219898159ab2d88992fe8ff1", "ja": "あっ、わかっちゃいましたか？　でへへ♪\n私いま、なんかウキウキしちゃってて～♪", "zh": "啊，您看出来啦？嘿嘿♪\n我现在心情特别雀跃～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0213_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "8afe34092747f10e535e4929b5e85c0aac090403e400d1b4f3beac81b1de89ea", "ja": "このワンピース、すっごくかわいいじゃないですか？\nだから私も、すっごく女の子～って気分です♪", "zh": "这条连衣裙特别可爱，对吧？\n所以我也感觉自己特别像个女孩子～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0213_1005_p", "source_sha256": "969dbb0997d7489aa969cdeb9778668fd38f46184581ef1d6c473285f5af3884", "ja": "はは、未来はもともと女の子だけどな！\nでも、喜んでもらえたみたいでよかったよ。", "zh": "哈哈，未来本来就是女孩子嘛！\n不过，看你这么开心，我也就放心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0213_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "2ac53b575fd796eed0117e24d44424d9c3fa0c1fd86d39d41037bcdb9c924d2d", "ja": "これからお揃いの子も増えるんですよね？　\nなんか姉妹みたいかも～♪", "zh": "以后也会有更多和我穿一样衣服的人吧？\n感觉就像姐妹一样呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0213_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "0d015d0da60db7ea0cfac931b429cb0e65fa972ab67798717ec7c54fc2cd680c", "ja": "今日はどんな写真ができるのかな～。\n雑誌が出たら、クラスのみんなに宣伝しようっと！", "zh": "今天会拍出什么样的照片呢～  \n杂志出了以后，我要向班上的大家宣传一下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0213_1008_p", "source_sha256": "8a229c4e9ad7fc3d90f9b673a8831389ca0c61749c7a9ebdb0bd9b6cb81e3d48", "ja": "おお、本当にはりきってるんだな。\nそれじゃ、とびきりの未来を撮ってもらおう！", "zh": "哦，看来你真的干劲十足啊。\n那就请你拍下最棒的未来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0213_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "d18a20e54f3321a2af99fa5bf33456fa681444a22edb2b0b9db7a1f860f8d642", "ja": "はいっ、わかりました！　……あ。\nごめんなさい、やっぱりわかりません！", "zh": "好的，我明白了！……啊。\n对不起，果然还是不明白！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0213_1010_p", "source_sha256": "7f277415e5d02cd23fd71a310492af443963bff5cd4a498e820bcc1940e2824e", "ja": "なにっ！？\n……えっと、なにがだ？", "zh": "什么！？\n……呃，你说的是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0213_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "3b75a40193030f0ce85193df22d35d978f58f23eb365db74cd3f174f0ba50c47", "ja": "とびきりの私って、どんな私なのかなぁって……。\n{$P$}さん、わかりますか？", "zh": "所谓“最棒的我”，究竟会是什么样的我呢……  \n{$P$}先生，你知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0213_1012_p", "source_sha256": "bee781965ca5302c6351cf4e1b94e2286908149d13f0f9544d3ef53f86554dd6", "ja": "ええっ？　そうだな……。例えば、\nいつもと違う姿で、ドキッとさせてみるとか？", "zh": "诶？这个嘛……比如，展现出和平时不一样的一面，让大家心动一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0213_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "54db673b0888232f1933a1f659107560fe7e66ee3352f925a9cd342f3d9ac4bb", "ja": "みんなを、ドキッとさせて……。\nあっ、わかったかも！", "zh": "让大家心跳加速……\n啊，我好像明白了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0213_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "800ac6e07ccc9e10cd9cc9758074fb86174966719fea18177acfbfcccbb6fc01", "ja": "私が「わあっ！」って、\n大きな木の影から飛び出すとかですね！？", "zh": "就是我喊着\"哇啊！\"，\n从大树的阴影里蹦出来，这样的感觉！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0213_1015_p", "source_sha256": "71cb5dde198af7cd854503439c232d24257556beb1f37e4f705a817309dd7ab9", "ja": "なるほど、ドキッというかビクッとしそうだな！\nそれも楽しそうだけど……。", "zh": "原来如此，感觉会让人心里一惊，或者吓一跳呢！\n那样也挺有意思的，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0213_1016_p", "source_sha256": "c0aa37ccf20ce798ddc7c6c64d5c7e8551aeb24eb740724ce265a7b4d74b2a78", "ja": "今、いつもと違う雰囲気の自分にドキドキしてる。\nそのままの未来を、今日はたくさん撮ってもらおうか。", "zh": "我现在正因和平时不一样的自己而心跳不已。\n今天就让大家多拍一些这样的未来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0213_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "24bc0ae1ec6ec08dd76b376059406ba88aff3558ecb2e208ed743a5264680c2a", "ja": "そのままの……\nこのままの、私……？", "zh": "就这样的……\n这样的我……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0213_1018_p", "source_sha256": "fbe471971730610f089369654255076e2b7e7bf8cec6cc97ae3975bda1c5ec1e", "ja": "そう。その衣装が魔法をかけてくれて、\n未来はとびきりかわいくなってるだろ？", "zh": "对。是那套服装施加了魔法，\n让未来变得特别可爱了，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0213_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "7a60a5354954638f456c644f82a26bb9590058156140e8d08366d8f9d386e8d7", "ja": "と、とびきり……そ、そんな、\n{$P$}さん、言い過ぎですよ～。", "zh": "特、特别可爱……没、没有啦，{$P$}先生，您夸得太过了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0213_1020_p", "source_sha256": "503413093bf91f2c25cc566990b88118a06b6663b773f5025f854a67fcfd78c3", "ja": "でもほら、未来もウキウキしてたじゃないか。\n写真を見たみんなも、絶対ドキドキしてくれるよ。", "zh": "不过你看，未来不也兴奋得不得了吗？看到照片的大家，也绝对会心跳加速的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0213_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "bfdb5f8cec9d3822625248f61068596836a68d453a1945937bdc49fa20fb96b2", "ja": "そ、そうなのかな……。\nそうだといいんですけど～。", "zh": "是、是这样吗……。\n要真是这样就好了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0213_1022_p", "source_sha256": "72bb0f09d66f38b6b4f7388d6232703cb4a420cf771a732f546c89ba0f8b75fa", "ja": "きっとそうなるって。さあ、自信を持って、\n今の未来をたくさん撮ってもらおう！", "zh": "一定会这样的。来，打起精神来，\n让大家多拍下现在的未来吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0213_1023_014mir", "source_sha256": "226a3f0847dac75ffed0d1c60900f4ffa9882c915e6cc17bf43832b994477057", "ja": "……えへへっ、ありがとうございます♪　じゃあ……\nドキドキしてる私、いっぱい撮ってもらいますね♪", "zh": "……嘿嘿，谢谢你♪ 那么……\n就请把心跳不已的我，多拍一些吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
